The [[Amulet of Energy]] is a rare item normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]] from the shop. It gives a brief 1s of 100% speed boost to one item next to it at start of battle. Probably more importantly, it refunds 25% of all used buffs, which, in the right build, could amount to a game-changing amount of saved buffs. This works great with {{icon/mana}}, or any other buffs that the player can manage to find ways to spend with item effects. Keep it in mind that refunded buffs can be duplicated by other items.

